<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Union Carbide said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Union Carbide said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Union Carbide Corp to neutral from attractive, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 45-5/8.</p>
</text>
